node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.dukascopy-cache/

# Raw 1m candle history is ~90MB per pair — too big for git.
# Published as assets on the `data-v1` GitHub Release instead; see README.
# Leading slash matters: an unanchored `data/` also swallowed src/data/.
/data/*
# Derived backtest output is small and worth versioning.
!/data/backtest-*.json
!/data/exit-variants-*.json
